  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Honduras Transportation And Freight Logistics Sector Reform Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Reformas del Sector Transporte y Logstica de Carga de Honduras II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es contribuir a la mejora del desempeo logstico de Honduras a travs de reformas sectoriales en los mbitos regulatorio, institucional, de planificacin y de facilitacin comercial, que permita ganancias en la competitividad e integracin regional. La presente operacin es la segunda de una serie de tres operaciones bajo la modalidad de Prstamo Programtico de Apoyo a Reformas de Poltica (PBP).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s objective is to support improvements in Honduras&apos;s logistics performance through regulatory, institutional, planning, and trade facilitation reforms in the sector, with a view to boosting competitiveness and regional integration. This is the second in a series of three operations under a programmatic policy-based loan (PBL).</narrative>
  </description>
